    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##  Welcome to AI Chat Lab!\r\nThis is just a sample activity for you to get your bearings with this learning environment, and **not** from the curriculum. Feel free to prompt the AI Chat as many times as you would like.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Finish the Sentence\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n1. Think about how you would complete the following sentence with a single word: *\"The dog barked at the...\"*\r\n2. **Copy and paste** the following prompt into AI Chat: \r\n\r\n>Complete this sentence with a single word: The dog barked at the...\r\n3. Press **Send**.\r\n4. Then read **AI Chat's response** and compare it to your own.\r\n\r\n**Try it out!**\r\n",
